-- title:
--   Index of an idèle box in the S-unit idèles
-- statement:
--   Let $R$ be a Dedekind domain with field of fractions $K$, where $K$ is a number field, let $S$ be a finite set of height-one primes of $R$, let $H_v \le (K_v)^\times$ be a subgroup of the units of the $v$-adic completion for each height-one prime $v$ of $R$, and let $H_w \le (K_w)^\times$ be a subgroup of the units of the completion at $w$ for each infinite place $w$ of $K$. Write $\mathbb{A}_K = \mathbb{A}_K^\infty \times \mathbb{A}_K^f$ for the adèle ring. Inside $(\mathbb{A}_K)^\times$ consider two subgroups: [`NumberField.AdeleRing.unitIdelesOutside R K S`](def/IsDedekindDomain_FiniteUnitIdelesOutside.html#L51), consisting of those units whose finite part $\delta$ satisfies $\delta_v, (\delta^{-1})_v \in \mathcal{O}_v$ for every $v \notin S$; and [`NumberField.AdeleRing.ideleBox R K S H Hinf`](def/NumberField_IdeleBox.html#L126), consisting of those units $x$ whose finite part satisfies the same integrality condition at each $v \notin S$, has $v$-component in $H_v$ for each $v \in S$, and whose component at each infinite place $w$ lies in $H_w$. The assertion is that the relative index of the second in the first, i.e. the index of their intersection in `unitIdelesOutside R K S`, equals $\bigl(\prod_{v \in S} [\,(K_v)^\times : H_v\,]\bigr) \cdot \prod_{w \mid \infty} [\,(K_w)^\times : H_w\,]$, with indices taken as natural numbers, the value $0$ recording an infinite index on either side.
--
--   This computes the index of an idèle box — local conditions imposed at the finitely many primes of $S$ and at all archimedean places — inside the group of $S$-unit idèles, as the product of the corresponding local indices. It is used in the derivation of the relative index of the subgroup generated by $p$-th powers of such a box and, downstream, in the prime-norm index estimates.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_NumberField_AdeleRing_relIndex_ideleBox_unitIdelesOutside.lean

